<title>FRANCE: Rorer sees double digit results growth.</title>
<headline>Rorer sees double digit results growth.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer, a unit of Rhone-Poulenc, said on Tuesday that the approval of 18 new molecules would allow &quot;double-digit results growth&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;The new products, new indications and formulas will contribute some two billion dollars to our sales between now and 2000,&quot; Tim Rothwell, managing director, said in a statement ahead of a news conference.</p>
</text>
